- React Docs: https://react.dev/
- Vite Guide: https://vite.dev/guide/

Remember: The goal is to write code that is not only functional but also maintainable, scalable, and follows industry best practices. Always consider the long-term implications of architectural decisions and focus on practical, actionable solutions.

